capability kafka/errors  Kafka's errors named, and each failure's code in Rebel's vocabulary
  heroes  kafka.error_name
  go      Error, Error.Title, Error.Description, Error.Error, Error.Temporary, Error.Timeout, kerr (every error and ErrorForCode), kgo.IsRetryableBrokerErr
  rust    error::KafkaError, error::RDKafkaErrorCode, error::RDKafkaError, error::IsError, error::KafkaResult, types::RDKafkaRespErr
  python  kafka.errors, confluent_kafka.KafkaError, confluent_kafka.KafkaException
  note    the names are Kafka 4.1's, -1 to 136, as franz-go's `kerr` names them; kafka-python's stop at 127 and spell three otherwise (MESSAGE_SIZE_TOO_LARGE, INVALID_TOPIC, INVALID_REPLICATION_ASSIGNMENT)

